IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `dg-core`
IMPORT `dg5-s228-consent-in-lieu-of-meeting`

-- Tests of dg5-s228-consent-in-lieu-of-meeting.l4 (8 Del. C. s 228).
-- Every expected value is written by hand from the text (src:935-940 of de-code-t8-ch1-2026-10-01.txt), beside the assertion.

§ `Section 228(a) and (b) -- how many votes the consents must carry`

-- helper arguments, in order: kind, the certificate provides otherwise, the number of votes carried by the consents, the number of votes entitled to be cast.
-- "a majority": more than half of all the votes entitled to be cast.
`dg5 test majority` MEANS `a majority of` `the outstanding stock entitled to vote`
`dg5 test two thirds` MEANS `at least` (2 DIVIDED BY 3) `of` `the outstanding stock entitled to vote`

#ASSERT `s 228(a) the stockholders may take the action without a meeting, without prior notice and without a vote` `a stock corporation` FALSE `dg5 test majority` 51 100 EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 228(a) the stockholders may take the action without a meeting, without prior notice and without a vote` `a stock corporation` FALSE `dg5 test majority` 50 100 EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 228(a) the stockholders may take the action without a meeting, without prior notice and without a vote` `a stock corporation` FALSE `dg5 test majority` 100 100 EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- "Unless otherwise provided in the certificate of incorporation": the consent route is shut.
#ASSERT `s 228(a) the stockholders may take the action without a meeting, without prior notice and without a vote` `a stock corporation` TRUE `dg5 test majority` 100 100 EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- A higher requirement: at least 2/3 of 100 votes is 66.67, so 66 is short and 67 is enough.
#ASSERT `s 228(a) the stockholders may take the action without a meeting, without prior notice and without a vote` `a stock corporation` FALSE `dg5 test two thirds` 66 100 EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 228(a) the stockholders may take the action without a meeting, without prior notice and without a vote` `a stock corporation` FALSE `dg5 test two thirds` 67 100 EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- Subsection (a) is for stockholders of a stock corporation: for a nonstock corporation it says nothing.
#ASSERT `s 228(a) the stockholders may take the action without a meeting, without prior notice and without a vote` `a nonprofit nonstock corporation that is not charitable` FALSE `dg5 test majority` 51 100 EQUALS NOTHING
-- Counts that cannot be a vote.
#ASSERT `s 228(a) the stockholders may take the action without a meeting, without prior notice and without a vote` `a stock corporation` FALSE `dg5 test majority` 5 0 EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 228(a) the stockholders may take the action without a meeting, without prior notice and without a vote` `a stock corporation` FALSE `dg5 test majority` 101 100 EQUALS NOTHING
-- Subsection (b): members of a nonstock corporation.
#ASSERT `s 228(b) the members may take the action without a meeting, without prior notice and without a vote` `a nonstock corporation with membership interests` FALSE `dg5 test majority` 3 5 EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 228(b) the members may take the action without a meeting, without prior notice and without a vote` `a charitable nonstock corporation` FALSE `dg5 test majority` 2 4 EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 228(b) the members may take the action without a meeting, without prior notice and without a vote` `a nonprofit nonstock corporation that is not charitable` TRUE `dg5 test majority` 5 5 EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 228(b) the members may take the action without a meeting, without prior notice and without a vote` `a stock corporation` FALSE `dg5 test majority` 5 5 EQUALS NOTHING

§ `Section 228(c) and (d) -- the consent itself`

-- helper arguments, in order: set forth in writing or electronic transmission, way delivered, by hand or certified/registered mail, in paper form,
-- system designated, information enabling date and identity, given by a proxy, proxy complies with s 212(c)(2) and (3), date delivered,
-- effective at a future time, date of the instruction, date of the future time, evidence provided, holder of record when executed,
-- holder of record on the record date, revoked before effective, irrevocable by a provision, votes carried.
GIVEN fm IS A BOOLEAN
      wy IS A `dg5 s 228(d)(1) Way a consent is delivered`
      hm IS A BOOLEAN
      pp IS A BOOLEAN
      ds IS A BOOLEAN
      inf IS A BOOLEAN
      px IS A BOOLEAN
      pxo IS A BOOLEAN
      dd IS A DATE
      fu IS A BOOLEAN
      di IS A DATE
      df IS A DATE
      ev IS A BOOLEAN
      h1 IS A BOOLEAN
      h2 IS A BOOLEAN
      rv IS A BOOLEAN
      ir IS A BOOLEAN
      vt IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `dg5 s 228 Consent delivered to the corporation`
`dg5 test consent` fm wy hm pp ds inf px pxo dd fu di df ev h1 h2 rv ir vt MEANS
    `dg5 s 228 Consent delivered to the corporation` WITH
          `the consent is set forth in writing or in an electronic transmission` IS fm
        , `the way the consent was delivered` IS wy
        , `the consent was delivered by hand or by certified or registered mail, return receipt requested` IS hm
        , `the consent was reproduced and delivered in paper form` IS pp
        , `the corporation has designated the information processing system` IS ds
        , `the consent sets forth or is delivered with information that enables the corporation to determine the date of delivery and the identity of the person giving it` IS inf
        , `the consent is given by a person authorized to act for a stockholder or member as proxy` IS px
        , `that proxy's consent complies with s 212(c)(2) and (3)` IS pxo
        , `the date on which the consent was delivered to the corporation` IS dd
        , `the consent is to be effective at a future time` IS fu
        , `the date on which the instruction or provision for the future time was given` IS di
        , `the date of the future time at which the consent is to be effective` IS df
        , `evidence of the instruction or provision for the future time was provided to the corporation` IS ev
        , `the signer was a stockholder or member of record when the consent was executed` IS h1
        , `the signer was a stockholder or member of record on the record date for determining those entitled to consent to the action` IS h2
        , `the consent was revoked before it became effective` IS rv
        , `the consent is made irrevocable by a provision otherwise providing` IS ir
        , `the number of votes the consent carries` IS vt

-- A good consent: in writing, delivered at the principal place of business on 10 March 2026 in paper form, immediate, signer of record at the time, not revoked, 100 votes.
`dg5 test good consent` MEANS `dg5 test consent` TRUE `to the principal place of business of the corporation` FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE (YMD 2026 3 10) FALSE (YMD 2026 3 1) (YMD 2026 3 1) FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE 100

-- The form: writing or electronic transmission.
#ASSERT `s 228(c) the consent is set forth in a permitted form` `dg5 test good consent`
#ASSERT NOT (`s 228(c) the consent is set forth in a permitted form` (`dg5 test consent` FALSE `to the principal place of business of the corporation` FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE (YMD 2026 3 10) FALSE (YMD 2026 3 1) (YMD 2026 3 1) FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE 100))
-- Delivery (i) and (ii): paper form needed.
#ASSERT `s 228(d)(1) the consent was delivered in a permitted way` `dg5 test good consent`
#ASSERT NOT (`s 228(d)(1) the consent was delivered in a permitted way` (`dg5 test consent` TRUE `to the principal place of business of the corporation` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE (YMD 2026 3 10) FALSE (YMD 2026 3 1) (YMD 2026 3 1) FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE 100))
#ASSERT `s 228(d)(1) the consent was delivered in a permitted way` (`dg5 test consent` TRUE `to an officer or agent of the corporation having custody of the book in which proceedings of meetings of stockholders or members are recorded` FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE (YMD 2026 3 10) FALSE (YMD 2026 3 1) (YMD 2026 3 1) FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE 100)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 228(d)(1) the consent was delivered in a permitted way` (`dg5 test consent` TRUE `to an officer or agent of the corporation having custody of the book in which proceedings of meetings of stockholders or members are recorded` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE (YMD 2026 3 10) FALSE (YMD 2026 3 1) (YMD 2026 3 1) FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE 100))
-- Delivery (iii): the registered office, by hand or by certified or registered mail, return receipt requested, and in paper form.
#ASSERT `s 228(d)(1) the consent was delivered in a permitted way` (`dg5 test consent` TRUE `to the registered office of the corporation in this State` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE (YMD 2026 3 10) FALSE (YMD 2026 3 1) (YMD 2026 3 1) FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE 100)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 228(d)(1) the consent was delivered in a permitted way` (`dg5 test consent` TRUE `to the registered office of the corporation in this State` FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE (YMD 2026 3 10) FALSE (YMD 2026 3 1) (YMD 2026 3 1) FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE 100))
#ASSERT NOT (`s 228(d)(1) the consent was delivered in a permitted way` (`dg5 test consent` TRUE `to the registered office of the corporation in this State` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE (YMD 2026 3 10) FALSE (YMD 2026 3 1) (YMD 2026 3 1) FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE 100))
-- Delivery (iv): the designated information processing system, with information on the date and the person, and for a proxy compliance with section 212(c)(2) and (3). No paper form needed.
#ASSERT `s 228(d)(1) the consent was delivered in a permitted way` (`dg5 test consent` TRUE `to an information processing system designated by the corporation for receiving consents, in accordance with section 116` FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE (YMD 2026 3 10) FALSE (YMD 2026 3 1) (YMD 2026 3 1) FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE 100)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 228(d)(1) the consent was delivered in a permitted way` (`dg5 test consent` TRUE `to an information processing system designated by the corporation for receiving consents, in accordance with section 116` FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE (YMD 2026 3 10) FALSE (YMD 2026 3 1) (YMD 2026 3 1) FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE 100))
#ASSERT NOT (`s 228(d)(1) the consent was delivered in a permitted way` (`dg5 test consent` TRUE `to an information processing system designated by the corporation for receiving consents, in accordance with section 116` FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE (YMD 2026 3 10) FALSE (YMD 2026 3 1) (YMD 2026 3 1) FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE 100))
#ASSERT `s 228(d)(1) the consent was delivered in a permitted way` (`dg5 test consent` TRUE `to an information processing system designated by the corporation for receiving consents, in accordance with section 116` FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE (YMD 2026 3 10) FALSE (YMD 2026 3 1) (YMD 2026 3 1) FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE 100)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 228(d)(1) the consent was delivered in a permitted way` (`dg5 test consent` TRUE `to an information processing system designated by the corporation for receiving consents, in accordance with section 116` FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE (YMD 2026 3 10) FALSE (YMD 2026 3 1) (YMD 2026 3 1) FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE 100))
-- "a consent permitted by this section".
#ASSERT `s 228(c) the consent is a consent permitted by this section` `dg5 test good consent`
#ASSERT NOT (`s 228(c) the consent is a consent permitted by this section` (`dg5 test consent` FALSE `to the principal place of business of the corporation` FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE (YMD 2026 3 10) FALSE (YMD 2026 3 1) (YMD 2026 3 1) FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE 100))
-- The first consent was delivered on 1 March 2026; 60 days after is 30 April 2026 (1 March + 30 = 31 March; + 30 = 30 April).
#ASSERT `s 228(c) the last day for sufficient consents to be delivered` (YMD 2026 3 1) EQUALS YMD 2026 4 30
#ASSERT `s 228(c) the consent was delivered within 60 days of the first date on which a consent was delivered` (`dg5 test consent` TRUE `to the principal place of business of the corporation` FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE (YMD 2026 4 30) FALSE (YMD 2026 3 1) (YMD 2026 3 1) FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE 100) (YMD 2026 3 1)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 228(c) the consent was delivered within 60 days of the first date on which a consent was delivered` (`dg5 test consent` TRUE `to the principal place of business of the corporation` FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE (YMD 2026 5 1) FALSE (YMD 2026 3 1) (YMD 2026 3 1) FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE 100) (YMD 2026 3 1))
-- A future time not later than 60 days after the instruction (instruction on 1 March; 60 days after is 30 April), with evidence given to the corporation.
#ASSERT `s 228(c) the future effectiveness of the consent is permitted` `dg5 test good consent`
#ASSERT `s 228(c) the future effectiveness of the consent is permitted` (`dg5 test consent` TRUE `to the principal place of business of the corporation` FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE (YMD 2026 3 10) TRUE (YMD 2026 3 1) (YMD 2026 4 30) TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE 100)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 228(c) the future effectiveness of the consent is permitted` (`dg5 test consent` TRUE `to the principal place of business of the corporation` FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE (YMD 2026 3 10) TRUE (YMD 2026 3 1) (YMD 2026 5 1) TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE 100))
#ASSERT NOT (`s 228(c) the future effectiveness of the consent is permitted` (`dg5 test consent` TRUE `to the principal place of business of the corporation` FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE (YMD 2026 3 10) TRUE (YMD 2026 3 1) (YMD 2026 4 30) FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE 100))
-- The signer: a holder of record when the consent was executed, or on the record date.
#ASSERT `s 228(c) the signer was a holder of record in time` `dg5 test good consent`
#ASSERT `s 228(c) the signer was a holder of record in time` (`dg5 test consent` TRUE `to the principal place of business of the corporation` FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE (YMD 2026 3 10) FALSE (YMD 2026 3 1) (YMD 2026 3 1) FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE 100)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 228(c) the signer was a holder of record in time` (`dg5 test consent` TRUE `to the principal place of business of the corporation` FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE (YMD 2026 3 10) FALSE (YMD 2026 3 1) (YMD 2026 3 1) FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE 100))
-- Revocation: revocable before it becomes effective, unless otherwise provided.
#ASSERT `s 228(c) the consent was effectively revoked` (`dg5 test consent` TRUE `to the principal place of business of the corporation` FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE (YMD 2026 3 10) FALSE (YMD 2026 3 1) (YMD 2026 3 1) FALSE TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE 100)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 228(c) the consent was effectively revoked` (`dg5 test consent` TRUE `to the principal place of business of the corporation` FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE (YMD 2026 3 10) FALSE (YMD 2026 3 1) (YMD 2026 3 1) FALSE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE 100))
#ASSERT NOT (`s 228(c) the consent was effectively revoked` `dg5 test good consent`)
-- Whether a consent counts toward the action.
#ASSERT `s 228(c) the consent counts toward the action` `dg5 test good consent` (YMD 2026 3 1)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 228(c) the consent counts toward the action` (`dg5 test consent` FALSE `to the principal place of business of the corporation` FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE (YMD 2026 3 10) FALSE (YMD 2026 3 1) (YMD 2026 3 1) FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE 100) (YMD 2026 3 1))
#ASSERT NOT (`s 228(c) the consent counts toward the action` (`dg5 test consent` TRUE `to the principal place of business of the corporation` FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE (YMD 2026 5 1) FALSE (YMD 2026 3 1) (YMD 2026 3 1) FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE 100) (YMD 2026 3 1))
#ASSERT NOT (`s 228(c) the consent counts toward the action` (`dg5 test consent` TRUE `to the principal place of business of the corporation` FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE (YMD 2026 3 10) TRUE (YMD 2026 3 1) (YMD 2026 5 1) TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE 100) (YMD 2026 3 1))
#ASSERT NOT (`s 228(c) the consent counts toward the action` (`dg5 test consent` TRUE `to the principal place of business of the corporation` FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE (YMD 2026 3 10) FALSE (YMD 2026 3 1) (YMD 2026 3 1) FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE 100) (YMD 2026 3 1))
#ASSERT NOT (`s 228(c) the consent counts toward the action` (`dg5 test consent` TRUE `to the principal place of business of the corporation` FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE (YMD 2026 3 10) FALSE (YMD 2026 3 1) (YMD 2026 3 1) FALSE TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE 100) (YMD 2026 3 1))
-- The votes of the consents that count: a good consent (100), a late one (40, delivered 1 May), a revoked one (30), another good one (25) = 125.
`dg5 test late consent` MEANS `dg5 test consent` TRUE `to the principal place of business of the corporation` FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE (YMD 2026 5 1) FALSE (YMD 2026 3 1) (YMD 2026 3 1) FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE 40
`dg5 test revoked consent` MEANS `dg5 test consent` TRUE `to the principal place of business of the corporation` FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE (YMD 2026 3 12) FALSE (YMD 2026 3 1) (YMD 2026 3 1) FALSE TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE 30
`dg5 test small good consent` MEANS `dg5 test consent` TRUE `to the principal place of business of the corporation` FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE (YMD 2026 3 15) FALSE (YMD 2026 3 1) (YMD 2026 3 1) FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE 25
#ASSERT `s 228(c) the votes carried by the consents that count` (LIST `dg5 test good consent`, `dg5 test late consent`, `dg5 test revoked consent`, `dg5 test small good consent`) (YMD 2026 3 1) EQUALS 125

§ `Section 228(d)(2) and (e)`

#ASSERT `s 228(d)(2) the reproduction may be used in lieu of the original writing` TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 228(d)(2) the reproduction may be used in lieu of the original writing` FALSE)
#ASSERT `s 228(d)(2) the consent is deemed to be in writing` TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 228(d)(2) the consent is deemed to be in writing` FALSE)
-- Notice to those who did not consent: less than unanimous, a stockholder or member on the record date, not a consenter, entitled to notice of the meeting.
#ASSERT `s 228(e) prompt notice of the taking of the action must be given to the person` TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 228(e) prompt notice of the taking of the action must be given to the person` FALSE TRUE FALSE TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 228(e) prompt notice of the taking of the action must be given to the person` TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 228(e) prompt notice of the taking of the action must be given to the person` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 228(e) prompt notice of the taking of the action must be given to the person` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE)
#ASSERT `s 228(e) the notice may be provided by a notice of internet availability of proxy materials` TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 228(e) the notice may be provided by a notice of internet availability of proxy materials` FALSE)
#ASSERT `s 228(e) the certificate must state that consent has been given in accordance with section 228 in lieu of the statement about a vote` TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 228(e) the certificate must state that consent has been given in accordance with section 228 in lieu of the statement about a vote` FALSE)
